---
---

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">About</h2>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-bio">
        <p class="lead">
          Growing up in New York City, I saw early on how environmental burdens fall unevenly across communities. That observation is what pulled me toward environmental engineering at Cornell, where I have spent the last three years studying the systems underneath those disparities. The more I learned, the more I realized that technical solutions and business and policy decisions are inseparable, which is why I decided to pursue business as well. I am passionate about work that is both challenging and makes tangible impacts.
        </p>

        <div class="about-meta">
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Education</span>
            <span class="meta-value">B.S. Environmental Engineering &amp; Business Minor<br />Cornell University · Expected May 2027</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Based in</span>
            <span class="meta-value">New York, NY &amp; Ithaca, NY</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Certification</span>
            <span class="meta-value">OSHA 40-Hour HAZWOPER</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <h3 class="sidebar-heading">Relevant Coursework</h3>
          <ul class="sidebar-list">
            <li>Energy Systems</li>
            <li>Fluid Mechanics</li>
            <li>Thermodynamics</li>
            <li>GIS &amp; Remote Sensing</li>
            <li>Environmental Quality Engineering</li>
            <li>Systems Analysis</li>
            <li>Engineering Economics</li>
            <li>Finance &amp; Financial Accounting</li>
            <li>Business Management</li>
            <li>Portfolio Analysis &amp; Investment Strategy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .lead {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .meta-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .sidebar-block {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg-deep);
  }

  .sidebar-heading {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .sidebar-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .sidebar-list li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sidebar-list li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
